--- productshot_baseline/docs/BLOCK9_GUIDED_LOCAL_INSTALL.md	1970-01-01 00:00:00.000000000 +0000
+++ productshot_v098_src/docs/BLOCK9_GUIDED_LOCAL_INSTALL.md	2026-08-22 14:55:32.615252026 +0000
@@ -0,0 +1,12 @@
+# ProductShot Block 9 — guided local model install
+
+Version: 0.9.9-guided-local-install (versionCode 55).
+
+Changes:
+- explicit local engine state;
+- primary action only when the user already has the compatible model ZIP;
+- in-app help explaining accepted package structure;
+- recovery action to remove incomplete/invalid previous installs;
+- the self-test remains gated until the installed model passes validation.
+
+The generative model is still external to the APK. ProductShot does not pretend that arbitrary ZIPs are valid model packages.
